  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good morning, Mr Whitcombe. The booking note says you've noticed black stools since starting ibuprofen. Is that right?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:01",
      "end_timestamp": "00:10",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Good morning, doctor. Yes, that is right. I have been passing black stools, and it rather alarmed my wife.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:11",
      "end_timestamp": "00:23",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And when did you first notice it?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:48",
      "end_timestamp": "00:53",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'm afraid I cannot say with any confidence. Possibly last week, possibly the week before. I did not make a note.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:56",
      "end_timestamp": "01:06",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's fine, plenty of people don't. Now, tell me about the ibuprofen. Who started you on it?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:07",
      "end_timestamp": "01:17",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My GP prescribed it for my knees. I take the 400 milligrams, I believe. The box is on the kitchen shelf, I'm afraid.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:19",
      "end_timestamp": "01:31",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Three times a day, with food. I take them every day, though I must admit I often forget the lunchtime one.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:40",
      "end_timestamp": "01:52",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It helps a little, but it doesn't make it safe. Have you been sick at all?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:19",
      "end_timestamp": "02:27",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, not once. I have felt quite well in that respect.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:29",
      "end_timestamp": "02:35",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Any pain in the stomach, even a dull ache after meals?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:36",
      "end_timestamp": "02:43",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No pain at all, which is partly why I put off coming.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:45",
      "end_timestamp": "02:51",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Fair enough. What about dizziness, say when you stand up quickly?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:54",
      "end_timestamp": "02:59",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, I have been quite steady on my feet, thank you.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:01",
      "end_timestamp": "03:08",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any other health problems I should know about?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:28",
      "end_timestamp": "03:33",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Osteoarthritis, which is the reason for the knees. And I have high cholesterol, but I manage that with diet.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:34",
      "end_timestamp": "03:43",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Understood. Any operations in the past?",
      "start_timestamp": "04:03",
      "end_timestamp": "04:06",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.surgical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "One. I had a hernia repair, about twelve years ago. It went very smoothly.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:09",
      "end_timestamp": "04:17",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.surgical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes please. Pulse is 92, blood pressure 118 over 74, oxygen level 98 percent, and your temperature is 36.8 degrees.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:20",
      "end_timestamp": "05:31",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Your tummy feels soft all the way round, which is reassuring.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:09",
      "end_timestamp": "06:16",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd rather not put a name on this just yet. But the first step is simple. Stop the ibuprofen from today.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:25",
      "end_timestamp": "06:36",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Understood. Should I simply stop it altogether, or cut down?",
      "start_timestamp": "06:38",
      "end_timestamp": "06:43",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes. If the stools stay black, or you feel faint, or you bring up blood, go to A and E straight away.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:22",
